  "content": "<h1><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/st35XgD.png\"></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">Если этому моду будет уделено достаточно внимания, в будущем планируется обновление с добавлением дополнительных големов.</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eZqO2q0.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moregolems\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1452714?logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=eb622b&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=eb622b\" alt=\"Загрузки с CurseForge\" width=\"161\" height=\"27\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmoregolems\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/moregolems?logo=modrinth&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=1bd96a\" alt=\"Загрузки с Modrinth\" width=\"175\" height=\"30\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcodderg.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Wiki-Read-2ea44f?logo=wikipedia&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=flat&amp;labelColor=111\" alt=\"Вики\" width=\"131\" height=\"30\"></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Andresv2017\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-Andresv2017-6F42C1?logo=github&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=flat&amp;labelColor=111\" alt=\"GitHub\" width=\"228\" height=\"31\"></a>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fBrvQ4AWGYu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/dynamic/json?url=https://discord.com/api/guilds/1385048182152626296/widget.json&amp;query=presence_count&amp;style=flat&amp;logo=discord&amp;logo